%!
% PDFX_def.ps — OutputIntent definition for the Medical Devices textbook press master.
% Uses Ghostscript's shipped default CMYK ICC profile as the output condition.

/ICCProfile (/usr/share/color/icc/ghostscript/default_cmyk.icc) def

[ /Title (Medical Devices - A Comprehensive Textbook for Pharmacy and Allied Health Sciences)
  /DOCINFO pdfmark

[/_objdef {icc_PDFX} /type /stream /OBJ pdfmark
[{icc_PDFX} <</N 4>> /PUT pdfmark
[{icc_PDFX} ICCProfile (r) file /PUT pdfmark

[/_objdef {OutputIntent_PDFX} /type /dict /OBJ pdfmark
[{OutputIntent_PDFX} <<
  /S /GTS_PDFX
  /Type /OutputIntent
  /DestOutputProfile {icc_PDFX}
  /OutputConditionIdentifier (Custom CMYK)
  /Info (Generic CMYK print condition - replace with printer ICC if supplied)
>> /PUT pdfmark
[{Catalog} <</OutputIntents [ {OutputIntent_PDFX} ]>> /PUT pdfmark
